    "Give it a name — it'll grow up carrying your letters, for as long as you keep Baranov." : {
      "comment" : "Text describing the purpose of the onboarding page where the user can give their ram a name.",
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "سمِّه اسماً — سينمو حاملاً رسائلك طالما تستخدم Baranov."
